{"key":"fixed-window-162c54aaca47cd6b","sourceHash":"162c54aaca47cd6baed05482889234b5938f58dcbab1e2af4c2c9dcc1e3a2966","pattern":"fixed-window","category":"sliding-window","title":"Fixed-Size Window: Mental Model","idea":"Add the entering item and remove the leaving item instead of recomputing each range.","complexity":"O(n) time · O(1) extra space","source":"fn greatest_k_sum(values: &[i32], k: usize) -> i32 {\n    assert!(k > 0 && k <= values.len());\n    let mut sum: i32 = values[..k].iter().sum();\n    let mut best = sum;\n    for i in k..values.len() {\n        sum += values[i] - values[i - k];\n        best = best.max(sum);\n    }\n    best\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let result = greatest_k_sum(&[2, 1, 5, 1, 3, 2], 3).to_string();\n    println!(\"{result}\");\n}\n","sites":[{"line":2,"function":"greatest_k_sum","statement":"assert!(k > 0 && k <= values.len());"},{"line":3,"function":"greatest_k_sum","statement":"let mut sum: i32 = values[..k].iter().sum();"},{"line":4,"function":"greatest_k_sum","statement":"let mut best = sum;"},{"line":5,"function":"greatest_k_sum","statement":"for i in k..values.len() {"},{"line":6,"function":"greatest_k_sum","statement":"sum += values[i] - values[i - k];"},{"line":7,"function":"greatest_k_sum","statement":"best = best.max(sum);"},{"line":8,"function":"greatest_k_sum","statement":"}"},{"line":9,"function":"greatest_k_sum","statement":"best"},{"line":13,"function":"main","statement":"let result = greatest_k_sum(&[2, 1, 5, 1, 3, 2], 3).to_string();"},{"line":14,"function":"main","statement":"println!(\"{result}\");"},{"line":15,"function":"main","statement":"}"}],"version":1,"input":"[2,1,5,1,3,2]","stdout":"9\n","values":[{"type":"&[i32]","data":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"2"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"5"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"3"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"2"}],"tuple":false}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"3"}},{"type":"i32","data"